<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0697_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kyle</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So I don’t forget how great it\nis to scrap you, how ’bout\fwe swap numbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bet! I DEFINITELY won’t forget\nabout you now!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see...\nToo bad...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh! I see you changed your mind\nabout swappin’ numbers\fwith me!{YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hm? Wait, lemme guess. You right\nnearby, ain’t you?\rIf you wanna talk to me, why don’t\nyou do it in person?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD!\rEnd of report!\fThis has been Kyle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know... Yesterday we beat a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\rEnd of report!\fNo questions.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh no... Just a lil while ago, a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} dipped...\rEnd of report!\f...It hurt. Report over.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You remember?\rThe moment we first scrapped!\rI wanna scrap again, to relive that\ntense moment! I got goosebumps!\rI’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You remember?\nWe had plans to scrap!\rI’m waitin’ for you on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}, so hurry up!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0697_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So, at last...\nYou FINALLY decided you wanna learn\ffrom the best fisherman.\rThat’s great.\nI’ll teach you.\rTo start...\nLook out at the top of the water.\fBreathe in deep.\fHold your fishin’ rod and stand still.\fAim at a spot real quiet.\fAnd, SHOO-OOOP! Cast your line!\rWhen you cast, keep a good\ngrip, or your Rod gon’ go with it.\fHold on TIGHT!\rThe hook and line gon’ sink into\nthe water, and you just wait\fwithout movin’.\rWell, if your nose itch or somethin’,\nI guess it’s OK to move a lil bit.\rAnd then, YOINK--you get a bite!\nYANK on the line and pull it outta\fthe water!\rGot it? YOINK and YANK!\nIf you YANK without a YOINK,\fyou gon’ look dumb, pullin’ up\fnothin’! Might not be a YOINK,\fmight be a BLOOP or a PLOOSH or a\fBLOOSH, or even a SPLOOSH-SPLOOSH...\f...Huh? I think we losin’ conn...\fction... Can...hear... Yo...? He...</language>
	</row>
</body>
